c147c92403bdefeee239c68f_original.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.2&amp;w=700&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1680720588&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=be7217121ca7f803e0b0ce079297c9f1\" data-thumb-url=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/n0datu6S4AG1EQZWGnxaMXuz2BMe0_vEX3wDDCWHqlnJZAabRjtlTaYcZYzcX77ViFpIUAev-zaU1ddUilzPG_jUwo30w6w7n1W0tTKikGQ9xmOlntiyFZSqFIGnBMREA1tUaekBLFy6aMjkoJNNRWMEk-TUVYp2vq0ohl_x9R6vkfUaW4czHU5kPOssy0NYU1lmLQtZS0SuShq_JliOeCqoMT7O9wJPIaN3lH3YRFD3CsQKd35Da_hhSirzt4i1B53HktzqdaGBVLX6Hq9cWH1h=s0-d-e1-ft#https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/040/499/954/c2e199ddc147c92403bdefeee239c68f_original.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.2&amp;w=700&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1680720588&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=be7217121ca7f803e0b0ce079297c9f1\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> Summary of it...<br /> <br /> <i>In <b>Stampede of Justice</b>, you play as Inspired who have gathered to watch famed Black and Native American aviatrix Bessie Coleman\u2019s air show. As an unknown force destroys her plane, it\u2019s up to you to figure out how to save her and the audience, figure out who\u2019s behind the plot, and bring them to justice.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Stampede of Justice</b> includes:<ul><li>Rules for playing and running a Trinity Continuum: Adventure! game, using the Storypath System</li> <li>An exciting story for you to bring to life, chock full of intrigue, super-science, and punching Nazis in the face</li> <li>Six fully playable ready-made characters, with backgrounds, motivations, and relationships with other characters</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-06-2023, 12:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T12:11:35-07:00","id":1507706,"title":"","content":"It does bother me a little that all of the PCs on the cover appear to be male while in the adventure itself half of the PCs are explicitly described as female.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T13:33:32-07:00","id":1507710,"title":"","content":"I think all the guys on the cover are Nazis getting gored by bulls","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T13:50:35-07:00","id":1507711,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the red armband is a bit of a giveaway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T21:25:55-07:00","id":1507737,"title":"","content":"Nazis enemies in story are called 'White Shirts' and 'Friends on New Germany' - so I assume cover is their final days, STAMPEDE by (cows) Justice. \ud83d\ude0e","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-28-2023, 05:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T17:25:01-07:00","id":1507802,"title":"","content":"Got done with my initial proofreading pass last night. Onyx Path still doesn't know how to follow their own character creation rules. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> At the simplest level, starting characters get 15 Skill points and 10 dots in Edges. Most of the ready-made characters fail to pass this very low bar.<br /> <br /> I next checked out the Gifts of the two stalwart characters. Stalwarts start with three Gifts from their Favored Approach and one Gift from any Approach. If pages 145-146 of Adventure! are correct, the three Favored Approach Gifts can be from any of their three Favored Approach Attributes. If page 183 of Adventure! is correct, they get one Gift from each of those Attributes. These two characters fail either way.<br /> <br /> Arjun has two Might Gifts despite favoring the Resilience Attributes.<br /> <br /> Madeline has four Dynamic Power Gifts, meaning they all lack Attribute keywords and by a narrow reading of the rules may not even count as her single &quot;any Approach&quot; Gift, due to their lack of Attribute keywords. Beyond that, she lacks the Gift prerequisite for her first Gift, and fails to meet the Attribute prerequisites for her next two Gifts.<br /> <br /> \u200bI'll hopefully get a chance to check the Gifts of the remaining four characters either tonight or tomorrow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T21:48:55-07:00","id":1507832,"title":"","content":"I just finished checking the Gifts for the remaining four ready-made characters. They're all wrong too.<br /> <br /> For the mesmerists, David gets off easy, since he simply doesn't meet the Command prerequisite for the Queen Takes Pawn Gift. Lynette has two Biological and two Cognitive Gifts (instead of three and one), and doesn't meet the Survival prerequisite for the Push the Pain Away Gift.<br /> <br /> The daredevils are supposed to have three Gifts associated with their starting Paths and one Gift of their choice. Joann only has one Gift associated with a Path, and fails to meet the Command prerequisite for one of the others. Klaus similarly only has one Gift associated with a Path, but he doesn't meet the Enigmas prerequisite for that Gift.<br /> <br /> Once I get done submitting these last few bits to the errata form, I'll be done with the jumpstart.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-03T20:49:25-07:00","id":1510668,"title":"","content":"Just finished checking the final version of Stampede of Justice versus the errata I submitted. It looks like they went from six ready to play characters with invalid starting Gifts to three ready to play characters with invalid starting Gifts. Weirdly, two of the three are daredevils. Strange that they're having trouble making valid characters for the default character type for the game line.<br /> <br /> Joann Robinson has no Gift from her Adventurer Path. She needs to replace either Easily Dismissed or Murderous Totality with a Pilot or Survival Gift (since she doesn't qualify for any Might Gifts).<br /> <br /> Klaus Weismann needs to swap A Reasonable Request for a Gift from either the Detective or International Detective Agency Paths (since his Aim Gift could count for either).<br /> <br /> \u200bMadeline Merlaux's entry seems very messed up. As a stalwart, she's supposed to have three Gifts from her Favored Approach and one Gift from any Attribute. She's got a Dynamic Power Gift as her &quot;any&quot; gift, which may or may not be valid based on a strict reading of the character creation process. She also has three Resilience Approach Gifts despite being listed as favoring the Force Approach. This could be corrected by swapping her Approach, except two of her three Gifts (Indomitable Will and Superlative Poise) are talent Gifts from the core book instead of super powered stalwart Gifts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-04T10:45:57-07:00","id":1510709,"title":"","content":"I cannot seem to find final version of Jumpstart at my DriveThruRPG account. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( I literally downloaded previous version at 6th of April, when starting this topic. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-04T13:25:01-07:00","id":1510716,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1507547-adventure-jumpstart-stampede-of-justice?p=1510709#post1510709\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I cannot seem to find final version of Jumpstart at my DriveThruRPG account. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( I literally downloaded previous version at 6th of April, when starting this topic. )</div> </div> </div> </div>If it isn't under the Updated Only tab, did you Archive it? That would be minimized at the bottom of the page.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-04T22:59:27-07:00","id":1510759,"title":"","content":"Founded my new version of PDF on Updated Only tab of my Library. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> There is no official portrait for <b>\u201cQueen\u201d Bessie Coleman</b> - She was real person in 1920s. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bessie_Coleman\" target=\"_blank\"><b>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bessie_Coleman</b></a><br /> <br /> So I made one. Literal first render in Leonardo AI (cause it's free). <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <img width=\"640\" height=\"832\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://cdn.leonardo.ai/users/5072e597-aba8-42f0-96e1-d3c851970bb8/generations/4ffa26f6-25bf-472b-984a-3df8c9c9a354/DreamShaper_v5_1930s_Black_American_and_Indigenous_aviatrix_in_1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://cdn.leonardo.ai/users/5072e597-aba8-42f0-96e1-d3c851970bb8/generations/4ffa26f6-25bf-472b-984a-3df8c9c9a354/DreamShaper_v5_1930s_Black_American_and_Indigenous_aviatrix_in_1.jpg\" data-thumb-url=\"https://cdn.leonardo.ai/users/5072e597-aba8-42f0-96e1-d3c851970bb8/generations/4ffa26f6-25bf-472b-984a-3df8c9c9a354/DreamShaper_v5_1930s_Black_American_and_Indigenous_aviatrix_in_1.jpg\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-08-2023, 01:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-08T09:40:55-07:00","id":1511074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shepherdboi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1507547-adventure-jumpstart-stampede-of-justice?p=1510668#post1510668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just finished checking the final version of Stampede of Justice versus the errata I submitted. It looks like they went from six ready to play characters with invalid starting Gifts to three ready to play characters with invalid starting Gifts. Weirdly, two of the three are daredevils. Strange that they're having trouble making valid characters for the default character type for the game line.<br /> <br /> Joann Robinson has no Gift from her Adventurer Path. She needs to replace either Easily Dismissed or Murderous Totality with a Pilot or Survival Gift (since she doesn't qualify for any Might Gifts).<br /> <br /> Klaus Weismann needs to swap A Reasonable Request for a Gift from either the Detective or International Detective Agency Paths (since his Aim Gift could count for either).<br /> <br /> \u200bMadeline Merlaux's entry seems very messed up. As a stalwart, she's supposed to have three Gifts from her Favored Approach and one Gift from any Attribute. She's got a Dynamic Power Gift as her &quot;any&quot; gift, which may or may not be valid based on a strict reading of the character creation process. She also has three Resilience Approach Gifts despite being listed as favoring the Force Approach. This could be corrected by swapping her Approach, except two of her three Gifts (Indomitable Will and Superlative Poise) are talent Gifts from the core book instead of super powered stalwart Gifts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for catching these! I've gone through and updated the characters to fix these issues.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Danielle Lauzon, Requiem Developer, Storypath Guru, freelance writer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6155-impernious","name":"impernious","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-08T10:00:50-07:00","id":1511076,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>impernious</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1507547-adventure-jumpstart-stampede-of-justice?p=1511074#post1511074\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thanks for catching these! I've gone thro